<title>USA: Norwest completes acquisition from Firstar.</title>
<headline>Norwest completes acquisition from Firstar.</headline>
<dateline>FARGO, N.D. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwest Corp said Tuesday it completed the acquisition of American Bank Moorhead from Firstar Corp.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed. American Bank Moorhead has $145 million in assets, with locations in Moorhead, Barnesville and Rothsay, Minn.</p>
<p>The transaction was contingent upon the completion of Firstar's previously announced acquisition of American Bancorporation Inc, the holding company of American Bank Moorhead. It was completed July 12.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
